+// Naxx40 Four Horsemen helper layer (overlay patch 0022). Spec (overlay repo):
+// docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-27-playerbot-naxx40-four-horsemen-design.md §4, §6.
+
+#include "Naxx40Horsemen.h"
+
